message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "@three-ws/witness"
abstract: "Turn a real user session into a runnable failing test. A tiny, privacy-first session recorder that captures intent (not pixels, not DOM mutations) and compiles it into a Playwright spec that stays red until the reported bug is fixed."
type: software
